BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20260819T231700Z
DESCRIPTION:NLP Reading Group:\nhttps://www.cs.utexas.edu/~ml/nll/index.h
 tml\n\n\nThe Natural Language Learning (NLL) reading group is a student-
 run group at UT Austin and part of the UT Austin NLP and Computational L
 inguistics community (https://www.nlp.utexas.edu/). We discuss recent pa
 pers in NLP\, ML\, and Computational Linguistics\, and occasionally host
  invited talks. All students\, postdocs\, and faculty interested in lang
 uage technologies are welcome to join!
