BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20260926T021838Z
DESCRIPTION:Directed Reading Program (DiRP) group on LLM Reasoning: LLMs 
 may just be stochastic parrots using next-token prediction\, but they ar
 e somehow able to perform shockingly well in a variety of tasks and demo
 nstrate complex reasoning. In this group we will read some landmark pape
 rs that have brought us from mere text auto-complete bots to powerful AI
  agents. We may potentially explore reasoning epistemically and advancem
 ents of AI reasoning beyond just text.
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261202T200000
DTSTAMP:20261124T190623Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261202T190000
EXDATE;TZID=America/Chicago:20261125T190000
